WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.965
It’s project time! Make a ScratchJr tap game: three characters that react when tapped, a green-flag start message and something moving forever.

2
00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:14.974
Put 3 characters on the stage.

3
00:00:14.974 --> 00:00:18.817
Each one does something funny when tapped.

4
00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:23.696
Use the green flag to say “Tap us!”.

5
00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:28.139
Add a background character that moves forever.

6
00:00:28.739 --> 00:00:31.713
Ask a friend to play.

7
00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:34.252
Did every character react?

8
00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:41.739
Use 👆 start on tap: the balloon grows 2 times, says “POP!” and hides.

9
00:00:41.739 --> 00:00:45.148
Grow, grow… POP! Great game reaction.

10
00:00:45.748 --> 00:00:49.591
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:54.739
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
